# Allowlist. The image is built from source inside Docker, so only what the Dockerfile COPYs belongs
# in the build context. The local node_modules/ and build/ are deliberately left out. CDK also uses
# this file when fingerprinting and staging the image asset, which keeps `cdk synth` fast.
*

!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/.npmrc
!/.tool-versions
!/tsconfig.json
!/card-data-version.txt
!/scripts
!/server

# Card data from `npm run get-cards`: re-include only test/json
!/test
/test/*
!/test/json
